source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: stdout(&output)
---
Manages code push releases

Usage: leptoskit codepush <COMMAND>

Commands:
  release  Packs a directory into a versioned release
  serve    Serves a release store for clients to update from, on the configured `serve.address`
  check    Checks for updates against a store, like a client would
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
